<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png"/><title>Monetary Policy Report to the Minnesota Business Partnership | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis</title><meta name="title" content="Monetary Policy Report to the Minnesota Business Partnership | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="description" content=""/><meta name="ess:pagetype" content="Speech"/><meta name="ess:publishdatetime" content="2014-07-08T17:45:00Z"/><meta name="sortDate" content="2014-07-08T17:45:00Z"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="/speeches/2014/monetary-policy-report-to-the-minnesota-business-partnership"/><meta property="og:title" content="Monetary Policy Report to the Minnesota Business Partnership | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="og:description" content=""/><meta property="og:image" content="/-/media/images/stock/president/kocherlakota/speaking/kocherlakota-narayana-speaking-opta-2col.jpg?rev=09fe8e4e88894e1a980a4a0b5a8c1c12"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Monetary Policy Report to the Minnesota Business Partnership | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="twitter:description" content=""/><meta name="twitter:url" content="/speeches/2014/monetary-policy-report-to-the-minnesota-business-partnership"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="/-/media/images/stock/president/kocherlakota/speaking/kocherlakota-narayana-speaking-opta-2col.jpg?rev=09fe8e4e88894e1a980a4a0b5a8c1c12?sc_lang=en"/><meta name="next-head-count" content="19"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/ba589f78dbc8687a-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5f5027ccbe3e5871-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/e77288c387d37b79-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5db7d341bde4960f-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/fc36caba970e3f79-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/56d8a1c2c4f9ae43-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/a09404883fbfd53c-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/504d972807344a18-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/cbb8a7defadc46de-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/css/4f1aae181a6905f3.css" as="style"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/4f1aae181a6905f3.css" data-n-g=""/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/css/706e79a094b4a8e8.css" as="style"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/706e79a094b4a8e8.css" data-n-p=""/><noscript data-n-css=""></noscript><script defer="" nomodule="" src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js"></script><script src="/js/libs/jquery-3.7.1.min.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/ie9.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/datatables/datatables.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/highcharts9/highcharts.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/highcharts9/modules/data.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/highcharts9/modules/exporting.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/highcharts9/highcharts-more.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/slick.min.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/js/libs/highcharts/modules/grouped-categories.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2f7e4dd8e9b8c7c9.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/framework-0c7baedefba6b077.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-2e9af072acc42982.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/pages/_app-07223c8603fe7746.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/936-ee5fbba03bf5027d.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/465-aeacec6b8cd79225.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/pages/%5B%5B...path%5D%5D-6586e949a9a60ebc.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/S1MNP8gH2s0dY_0hYASSP/_buildManifest.js" defer=""></script><script src="/_next/static/S1MNP8gH2s0dY_0hYASSP/_ssgManifest.js" defer=""></script><style id="__jsx-554125439">:root{--font-barlow:'__barlow_b63fa2', '__barlow_Fallback_b63fa2', 'Barlow', san-serif;--font-nunito:'__nunito_7fd573', '__nunito_Fallback_7fd573', 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif}</style></head><body><noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-PTBLDZW" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript><script async="">var _ctct_m = "893dd8ef8163c5909e767b76354dca4e";</script><script id="signupScript" src="https://static.ctctcdn.com/js/signup-form-widget/current/signup-form-widget.min.js" async=""></script><div id="__next"><div id="i9-t-base"><header id="header-nav" class="i9-c-header__container container-fluid"><a class="i9-c-header__skip" href="/speeches/2014/monetary-policy-report-to-the-minnesota-busine